,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":2199130706,"text":"改めて——ネフェルさん、ヤフォダさん…協会へのご協力、ありがとうございました。","nextNodeIds":[761290102]},{"nodeId":761290102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":3454769866,"text":"ただの協力なんだから、そこまで気を遣わなくていいよ。","nextNodeIds":[761290103]},{"nodeId":761290103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7016,"speakerName":"サリーン","textMapHash":3250645842,"text":"そうは言っても、ネフェルさんには感謝しないと。協会の…複雑な調査活動にご協力いただけたのですから。","nextNodeIds":[761290104]},{"nodeId":761290104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":771171938,"text":"冒険者協会からも人を出してもらって、こっちの活動を手伝わせたんだから、ウィンウィンってなものさ。","nextNodeIds":[761290105]},{"nodeId":761290105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":1418160274,"text":"これからも、よろしく頼むよ、サリーンさん。","nextNodeIds":[761290106]},{"nodeId":761290106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7016,"speakerName":"サリーン","textMapHash":2014514706,"text":"ご安心ください。私たち冒険者協会は…","nextNodeIds":[761290107]},{"nodeId":761290107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7016,"speakerName":"サリーン","textMapHash":923898274,"text":"いえ、正確に申し上げると、私たちナド・クライ冒険者協会支部は、間違いなく信頼してくださって大丈夫ですから。","nextNodeIds":[761290108]},{"nodeId":761290108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":3923194466,"text":"ふふ、見れば分かるさ。","nextNodeIds":[761290109]},{"nodeId":761290109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":736308290,"text":"（そうそうそう、いい感じ。姐さん、そのままそのまま…そう、そっちを見てて。頼むからこっちを見ないでくれよ——）","nextNodeIds":[761290110]},{"nodeId":761290110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":478856338,"text":"ヤフォダ、どうして黙ってるんだい？","nextNodeIds":[761290111]},{"nodeId":761290111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":3226805002,"text":"（あー！こっち見ないでってば！掲示板は見ないで見ないで見ないで——）","nextNodeIds":[761290112]},{"nodeId":761290112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2710803362,"text":"え？あ、あたい？だって、特に言うこと思いつかなかったから…依頼をくれて、ありがとう？","nextNodeIds":[761290113]},{"nodeId":761290113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7016,"speakerName":"サリーン","textMapHash":2683326490,"text":"ふふ、ヤフォダさんにも感謝いたします。あなたがいなければ、協会の業務は山積みになっていたことでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[761290114]},{"nodeId":761290114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":1299218738,"text":"いやいや…お金をもらった以上、ちゃんと仕事するのは当然のことだよ。","nextNodeIds":[761290115]},{"nodeId":761290115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":92531218,"text":"（はぁ、前に教えた話術、またすっかり忘れてるね…？）","nextNodeIds":[761290116]},{"nodeId":761290116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":2704969650,"text":"そうだ、せっかく来たんだ…","nextNodeIds":[761290117]},{"nodeId":761290117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":1072525194,"text":"（やめて！せっかくいい雰囲気なのに。姐さん、見逃してよう！）","nextNodeIds":[761290118]},{"nodeId":761290118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":695311946,"text":"サリーンさん、最新の依頼を持ってきてもらえるかい？","nextNodeIds":[761290119]},{"nodeId":761290119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":496882610,"text":"ヤフォダ、一つ選んでみな。あんたが一番やるべきだと思う依頼をね。","nextNodeIds":[761290120]},{"nodeId":761290120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","textMapHash":2304612938,"text":"よく考えて、ゆっくり選ぶんだ。","nextNodeIds":[761290121]},{"nodeId":761290121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2908038362,"text":"は…はい、ボス…","nextNodeIds":[761290122]},{"nodeId":761290122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":3529513050,"text":"（うわぁ～、もう！ダメ！だぁ～～！）","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7612901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCA